Thank you. the problem is solve, I define it in classpath it didn't work,  but when I added it to HDFS file path it is working perfectly,

I need to copy hbase and zookeeper jar in hdfs path.
rhput("/home/bikash/builds/hbase-0.90.5/hbase-0.90.5.jar" , "/home/bikash/tmp/hbase-0.90.5.jar");
rhput("/home/bikash/builds/hbase-0.90.5/lib/zookeeper-3.3.2.jar",  "/home/bikash/tmp/zookeeper-3.3.2.jar");

Problem is solved. Thank you.

Regards
Bikash

