in hbaseif, this is what happens

mapred$rhipe.hbase.colspec <- paste(colspec,collapse=",")

I.e for colspec="", mapred$rhipe.hbase.colspec is "".

So would in https://github.com/bikash/RhipeHbaseMozilla/blob/master/java/org/godhuli/rhipe/hbase/RHHBaseGeneral.java#L167 would this be NULL?

Your java code assumes when colspec == "", this line will return FALSE.

Is that what is really happening?

